        "original_id": "cb45f516-35f7-502d-91af-75dfa9efa69b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Dandong, Hotan, Liaoning, Xinjiang, China\n- Companies: SG Automotive Group\n\nFacts:\n- Dandong, formerly known as Andong, is a prefecture-level city in southeastern Liaoning province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Hotan, also transliterated from Chinese as Hetian, is a major oasis town in southwestern Xinjiang, an autonomous region in western China.\n- SG Automotive Group Co Ltd, officially Liaoning Shuguang Automotive Group, Ltd, is a Chinese vehicle and component manufacturer headquartered in Dandong, Liaoning province.",
